 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 필기 도구 : 연필, 샤프 (컴퓨터용싸인펜 가능)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 인정 신분증 : 학생증 또는 주민등록증, 운전면허증, 기간 만료전 여권</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 입실 시간 : 18시 10분</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕\">※ 첨부파일의 해당 고사실을 반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕\">본인 이름이 없는 경우 국제교류교육원으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">T. 054-478-7959</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; 