EN-US\">- 확인방법 : 모의시험 → 왼쪽 모의토익 → 성적확인 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">성적증명서 발급 및 성적 분석데이터 제공</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #282828 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">모의토익 시험 고사장은</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #282828 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\">테크노관입니다.</span></u></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #282828 single\"></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕\">☆ 해설특강 안내 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">5월 23일(금) 20:40 ~ 21:40</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 30pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span 